{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o069","title":"虞翻以为力不能拒不如避之，王朗自以身为汉吏宜保城邑，举兵与孙策战，败绩，浮海至东冶","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-566ab33eb8e3c3e74386","label":"正文","text":"虞翻以为力不能拒不如避之，王朗自以身为汉吏宜保城邑，举兵与孙策战，败绩，浮海至东冶","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-2f79544b24a959d2e98d","label":"正文","text":"孙策又追击大破之，朗乃诣策，策以其儒雅诘让而不害","evidence":["zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-d3144cd3eb2010b20ce4","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"孙策率军如闽越讨王朗；朗泛舟浮海欲走交州，为兵所逼遂诣军降","evidence":["zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-f0f4e29100f551149fb8","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"孙策令使者诘故会稽太守王朗，责其阻兵安忍、捕得云降庶以欺诈","evidence":["zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-79e7b19315689b9a0385","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"王朗称禽虏，对使者自陈琐才误窃朝私、畏死苟免、委命下隶、死有余辜","evidence":["zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-39b17fbc481227b644ef","label":"裴注·汉晋春秋","text":"孙策之始得王朗也谴让之，使张昭私问朗，朗誓不屈；策忿而不敢害，留置曲阿","evidence":["zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-c51a7e7ec7b7f63a5a61","label":"正文","text":"会稽太守王朗拒策于固陵，策数渡水战不能克","evidence":["zongshi-q-812211891c45b57fe0f7"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-71dd3caccfae93c66b14","label":"正文","text":"策乃诈令军中：顷连雨水浊兵饮之多腹痛，令促具罂缶数百口澄水；至昏暮，罗以燃火诳朗","evidence":["zongshi-q-0871ec4bcb18052d7928"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-459dae87f17884f6da54","label":"正文","text":"策便分军夜投查渎道，袭高迁屯","evidence":["zongshi-q-ab16c68fef2d24ca3355"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-078ff85c54901733f5c2","label":"正文","text":"朗大惊，遣故丹杨太守周昕等帅兵前战；策破昕等，斩之，遂定会稽","evidence":["zongshi-q-fa41b26c2da52e9bfc0e"]},{"id":"yululu-a-9061a3bf41ae7dbcf66c","label":"正文","text":"虞翻脱缞入见劝王朗避孙策，朗不能用","evidence":["yululu-q-e7d7718a17208557d2a3"]},{"id":"yululu-a-225e85a1daa500288c71","label":"正文","text":"王朗拒战孙策败绩，亡走浮海","evidence":["yululu-q-df33c5d11094d6f092b4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0309","role":"举兵与策战败绩者；诣策受诘让而不害者；泛海被逼诣降者；被诘之故会稽太守；对使者自陈之降虏；誓不屈者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101","zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"劝避之之功曹","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"与之战之江东势力主；追击大破并诘让王朗者；讨朗者；令使者诘朗者；谴让留置朗者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"奉使私问者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"person":"wudi-p0077","role":"帅兵被斩者","evidence":["zongshi-q-fa41b26c2da52e9bfc0e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101","zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","source_order":[13,227,7],"order":2897}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0133","name":"张昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0077","name":"周昕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0309","name":"王朗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0058","name":"虞翻","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-df33c5d11094d6f092b4","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ea6aaeb29afc5ea6f7f6","layer":"original","quote":"拒战败绩〖5〗，亡走浮海","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":77,"end":89},{"id":"yululu-q-e7d7718a17208557d2a3","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ea6aaeb29afc5ea6f7f6","layer":"original","quote":"朗欲就之〖4〗，翻乃脱缞入见，劝朗避策。朗不能用","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":52,"end":76},{"id":"zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-666db06c8a588c4d2d84","layer":"pei","quote":"朗称‘禽虏’，对使者曰：‘朗以琐才，误窃朝私；受爵不让，以遘罪网。前见征讨，畏死苟免；因治人物，寄命须臾。又迫大兵，惶怖北引。从者疾患，死亡略尽；独与老母，共乘一。流矢始交，便弃N就俘，稽颡自首于征役之中。朗惶惑不达，自称降虏。缘前迷谬，被诘惭惧。朗愚浅驽怯，畏威自惊；又无良介，不早自归。于破亡之中，然后委命下隶。身轻罪重，死有余辜。申脰就鞅，蹴足入绊，叱咤听声，东西惟命。","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1641ee7b80f85e5d4c75","start":146,"end":334},{"id":"zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-bdb723f3bc5117145c5c","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策之始得朗也，谴让之。使张昭私问朗，朗誓不屈。策忿而不敢害也，留置曲阿。","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2306eeaa6e63e60050cb","start":139,"end":176},{"id":"zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-666db06c8a588c4d2d84","layer":"pei","quote":"策令使者诘朗曰：‘问逆贼故会稽太守王朗：朗受国恩当官，云何不惟报德，而阻兵安忍？大军征讨，幸免枭夷；不自扫屏，复聚党众，屯住郡境。远劳王诛，卒不悟顺。捕得云降，庶以欺诈；用全首领，得尔与不？具以状对。’","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1641ee7b80f85e5d4c75","start":45,"end":146},{"id":"zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6d86d8986119b990a99c","layer":"original","quote":"朗功曹虞翻以为力不能拒〖6〗，不如避之。朗自以身为汉吏，宜保城邑，遂举兵与策战；败绩，浮海至东冶","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":7,"end":55},{"id":"zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6d86d8986119b990a99c","layer":"original","quote":"策又追击，大破之，朗乃诣策。策以〔其〕儒雅，诘让而不害〖8〗。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":59,"end":90},{"id":"zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-666db06c8a588c4d2d84","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策率军如闽、越，讨朗。朗泛舟浮海，欲走交州；为兵所逼，遂诣军降。","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1641ee7b80f85e5d4c75","start":12,"end":45},{"id":"zongshi-q-0871ec4bcb18052d7928","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"乃诈令军中曰：“顷连雨，水浊，兵饮之多腹痛。令促具罂缶数百口，澄水〖5〗。”至昏暮，罗以燃火诳朗","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":113,"end":161},{"id":"zongshi-q-812211891c45b57fe0f7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"是时太守王朗，拒策于固陵〖3〗；策数渡水战，不能克","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25},{"id":"zongshi-q-ab16c68fef2d24ca3355","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"便分军夜投查渎道，袭高迁屯","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":165,"end":178},{"id":"zongshi-q-fa41b26c2da52e9bfc0e","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"朗大惊，遣故丹杨太守周昕等，帅兵前战。策破昕等，斩之，遂定会稽","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":185,"end":216}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
